1007102","armor":"WP1016405","helmet":"WP1025305","horse":"WP29018"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[35,25,70,72,75,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"14550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016405","helmet":"WP1025305","horse":"WP29018"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10001","city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[35,25,70,72,75,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"14550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016405","helmet":"WP1025305","horse":"WP29018"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"韦端次子，书法家，建安年间举孝廉，拜郎中，累迁侍中、中书监，以光禄大夫逊位。太和年间任武都太守，因善书留补侍中。魏国重要器皿铭题多出其手。青龙年间，洛阳、许昌、邺三都宫观建成，诏令韦诞题署。","tc":"韋端次子，書法家，建安年間舉孝廉，拜郎中，累遷侍中、中書監，以光祿大夫遜位。太和年間任武都太守，因善書留補侍中。魏國重要器皿銘題多出其手。青龍年間，洛陽、許昌、鄴三都宮觀建成，詔令韋誕題署。","en":"The second son of Wei Duan and a noted calligrapher. During the Jianan era, he was nominated Filial and Incorrupt and appointed Gentleman of the Palace, subsequently rising to Commandant and Director of the Secretariat before retiring with the rank of Minister of Oration. During the Taihe era, he served as Governor of Wudou, but was retained as Commandant due to his excellence in calligraphy. Most inscriptions upon the state vessels and plaques of Wei were brushed by his hand. During the Qinglong era, upon the completion of palaces and temples across the three capitals of Luoyang, Xuchang, and Ye, an imperial decree ordered Wei Dan to pen their inscriptions.","jp":"韋端の次男。書家。建安年間に孝廉に挙げられ、郎中を拝す。累進して侍中、中書監となり、光禄大夫をもって致仕した。太和年間には武都太守に任じられたが、書に巧みであったため都に留め置かれて侍中に補任された。魏国の重要な器物の銘題の多くは彼の手によるものであった。青龍年間に洛陽、許昌、鄴の三都の宮観が完成すると、詔により韋誕が題署を命じられた。","kr":"위단의 차남이자 서예가이다. 건안 연간에 효렴으로 천거되어 낭중에 제수되었고, 누차 승진하여 시중과 중서감에 올랐으며 광록대부로서 관직에서 물러났다. 태화 연간에 무도태수로 임명되었으나, 글씨에 능하여 조정에 머무르며 시중에 보임되었다. 위나라 중요 기물의 명문은 대부분 그의 손에서 나왔다. 청룡 연간에 낙양, 허창, 업의 삼도 궁관이 완공되자, 조서를 내려 위탄에게 편액을 쓰도록 하였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1039415","remark":"","surname":"韦","surnameTc":"韋","surnameEn":"Wei","surnameJp":"韋","surnameKr":"위","surnameOther":"","name":"诞","nameTc":"誕","nameEn":"Dan","nameJp":"誕","nameKr":"탄","nameOther":"","word":"仲将","wordTc":"仲將","wordEn":"Zhongjiang","wordJp":"仲将","wordKr":"중장","wordOther":"","icon":"韦诞","power":"WJ10001","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"193","city":"CS1027","gender":"0","rule":"35","force":"25","wise":"70","politics":"72","charm":"75","will":"67","ruleTalent":"5","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"14/11/12/12/12/70/15/14","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1002105","warSoulPoint":"3100","battleSoulPoint":"3800","debateSoulPoint":"6000","strategy":"","strategy2":"1004801","professions":"2/0/0/0/1/0/0/1/1/3/3/0/1/3/0/3/2/2/2/3/2/0/3/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"18","loyalty":"0","reputation":"14550","evaluate":"2200","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"179","show":"192","death":"253","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016405","helmet":"WP1025305","treasure":"","horse":"WP29018","shield":"","character":"2/2;8/1;11/1;18/1;25/1;31/0;42/2;21/1","father":"WJ1039915/0","mother":"","children":"WJ1040215/100","family":"WJ1040015/100","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"WJ10163/6","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","sta